  "surface_convention": {
    "authority": "which class is measured how is read from parcel_robot.navigation.arrival_semantics.localization_target; this artifact holds no class -> metric map of its own",
    "measures": {
      "interior": {
        "applies_to": "inside-class places (region)",
        "note": "bare containment is UNINFORMATIVE for large regions: the bench measured sidewalk and crosswalk at 0.00 m against a RANDOM map (p=1.00, p=0.52). The evidence fraction is what a random map cannot pass, and the null control is what proves it in any particular scene.",
